Source: apollo-mcp-server-@MAJOR@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Docker Hardened Images <dhi@docker.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://www.apollographql.com/docs/apollo-mcp-server

Package: apollo-mcp-server-@MAJOR@
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Conflicts: apollo-mcp-server, apollo-mcp-server-1, apollo-mcp-server-2
Description: Model Context Protocol server for GraphQL APIs (major @MAJOR@)
 The Apollo MCP Server exposes GraphQL operations from a schema or an Apollo
 GraphOS graph as Model Context Protocol tools, letting MCP clients query a
 GraphQL API without writing GraphQL. It serves stdio and streamable HTTP
 transports. This package provides the apollo-mcp-server binary.
